{"pin":"BH05823","subcodes":[{"code":"BH05823","anchor":"","first_line":"Thy letter hath reached Our presence, and We have taken cognizance of its contents. We beseech God that He may unveil unto thee that which thou didst seek [3.5s]... ...Unto Thee be praise, O Lord my God! I entreat Thee, by Thy signs that have encompassed the entire creation","first_line_orig":"قد حضر کتابک بین یدینا و اطلعنا بما فیه نسئل الله بان یکشف لک ما اردته... سبحانک اللّهمّ یا الهی اسئلک بآیاتک الّتی احاطت الممکنات   ","language":"Ara","word_count":"170","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"it","lang_name":"Italian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"de","lang_name":"German"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15739.279","source":"BLIB_Or15739","locator":"279"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA27:473","source":"INBA27","locator":"473","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba-v027/?page=237"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA48:155","source":"INBA48","locator":"155","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v048/?page=157"},{"kind":"publication","code